OL,3,AEx-media executive admits saying
OL,4,AAustralian child sex abuse survivor
OL,5,A'looking to be raped again'
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn Australian media mogul has admitted
OL,8,Fhe said a child sex abuse survivor and
OL,9,Fprominent advocate "must be looking to
OL,10,Fbe raped again" because of the way she
OL,11,Fwas dressed at an event.
OL,13,FGrace Tame, 31, was groomed and abused
OL,14,Fby a teacher and has been honoured as
OL,15,FAustralian of the Year in 2021 for her
OL,16,Fadvocacy work on child safety.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
